"answerCandidates":[],"studentLayout":{"material":"<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">5．（6分）阅读下面两首诗歌，完成下列各题。</span></p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:6px;vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">甲</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">]</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">蜀中九日</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">唐•王勃</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">九月九日望乡台，</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">他席他乡</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>①</sup></span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">送客杯。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">人情已厌南中</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>②</sup></span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">苦，</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">鸿雁那</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>③</sup></span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">从北地来。</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:6px;vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">乙</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">]</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">冬夜送人</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">唐•贾岛</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">平明走马上东桥，</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">花落梅溪雪未消。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">日短天寒愁送客，</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">楚山无限路迢迢。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">①</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">他席：这里指为友人送行的酒席。他乡：异乡。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">②</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">南中：南方，这里指四川一带。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">③</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">那：为何。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">④</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">平明：天刚亮的时候。</span></p>","parts":[{"key":"01","section":null,"header":"","ids":["SJZ-4B76C6303387#01"]},{"key":"02","section":null,"header":"","ids":["SJZ-4B76C6303387#02"]},{"key":"03","section":null,"header":"","ids":["SJZ-4B76C6303387#03"]}],"sections":[]},"searchText":"5．（6分）阅读下面两首诗歌，完成下列各题。[甲]蜀中九日唐•王勃九月九日望乡台，他席他乡①送客杯。人情已厌南中②苦，鸿雁那③从北地来。[乙]冬夜送人唐•贾岛平明走马上东桥，花落梅溪雪未消。日短天寒愁送客，楚山无限路迢迢。①他席：这里指为友人送行的酒席。他乡：异乡。②南中：南方，这里指四川一带。③那：为何。④平明：天刚亮的时候。\n（1）[甲]诗和[乙]诗中的首句都交代了送别的 　     　 和 　     　 。\n（2）发挥合理想象，描绘[乙]诗中“花落梅溪雪未消”呈现的画面。\n（3）两首诗都写到了送别，但表达的感情略有不同，请简要分析。","sourceVersionRef":"39d772aa5a07c89acf2d","contentHistory":[{"ref":"fd79f1a14ea12d038888","date":"2026-10-30","reason":"本批提取/来源定位版本"},{"ref":"ff74c4ca8baa807036a4","date":"2026-10-30","reason":"本批提取/来源定位版本"}],"qualityAudit":{"previousAnswerStatus":"所供解析答案已逐问挂接（非官方终审）"}},"questions":{"SJZ-4B76C6303387#01":{"summary":"（1）[甲]诗和[乙]诗中的首句都交代了送别的 　     　 和 　     　 。","sourc